The code would be:
```cs
public static int Sum(int x, int y)
{
    sum = x + y;
    // @@@ sum is greater than or equal to x and y 
    return sum;
}
```
The corresponding Debug.Assert is:

<code>
Debug.Assert((sum >= x && sum >= y));
</code>

