The PUT_IndexOfContract method has a comment "@@@ If the return value is negative, list count remains same". This comment can be translated as "If the return value of the IndexOf method is negative (which means the item is not in the list), then the list count should remain the same after indexing the item.". So the debug.Assert statement that corresponds to this comment is: 

```cs
Debug.Assert(New_Ret < 0 && New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount);
```--------------------
